  "description": "Motobecane Elite Adventure PRO 29er adventure hybrid: built for riders who want one flat bar bike for commuting, fitness rides, bike paths, dirt roads and groomed trails. The advanced 6061 aluminum frame combines fast 700c/29er rolling with wide tire clearance and confident flat bar control.\n\nSRAM Eagle 1x12 drivetrain: wide-range 11-50T gearing gives simple one-shifter control and low climbing gears without a front derailleur.\n\nRockShox Recon lockout suspension: the 100mm front fork helps smooth rough pavement, gravel and trail chatter, while lockout keeps the bike efficient on smoother roads.\n\nHydraulic disc brakes and WTB wheels: SRAM hydraulic disc brakes, WTB TCS tubeless-compatible 29/700c wheels, and room for tires up to 29 x 2.35 make this bike more capable than many fitness hybrids.",
